	  The exported C entry point remains as an ABI adapter.

	  This is part of the experimental native Rust kernel migration.
	  If unsure, say Y.

config RUST_MAPLE_TREE_LOAD
	bool "Rust implementation of Maple Tree loads"
	depends on RUST && X86_64
	default y
	help
